## What to do next

{% if category == 'build' %}
- Suggested owner: component team.
- Open the linked PipelineRun and ask the component team to review the failure.
- If the failure looks temporary, such as an infrastructure timeout, comment /retest on the component PR.
- If the failure is caused by code or configuration, ask the component team to fix it in the component PR.
{% elif category == 'conflict' %}
- Suggested owner: component team.
- Ask the component team to resolve the conflict between {{ source_branch }} and {{ destination_branch }} in the promotion PR.
- After they push the resolution, wait for GAP to refresh the mergeability check.
{% else %}
- Suggested owner: workflow owner.
- Ask the workflow owner to inspect the linked feasibility workflow.
- Ask them to fix the reported sync or workflow problem.
{% endif %}
- Keep this ticket open. GAP will update it automatically after a new current-head result; do not close it manually.

{% if category == 'feasibility' %}
## Main-to-release feasibility

The main to release feasibility job has failed. This job dry-runs the normal sync from the current configured source branch to configured active release branches (It does not test the proposed stable PR contents or actually push changes). Please inspect the feasibility job for merge conflicts or configuration/workflow errors.
